From: appkins <nbatkins@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: build the CDC-ACM serial console driver

The nanokvm BMC's serial console function moved from f_serial (gser,
vendor-specific class 0xFF, nothing binds it) to f_acm. A booted Linux
picks CDC-ACM up with cdc_acm and needs nothing from firmware, but EDK2
has no in-tree CDC-ACM SerialIo driver -- UsbSerialDxe in edk2-platforms
is FTDI-specific -- so pre-boot console redirection over the same port
needs NucRedfishPkg/UsbCdcAcmDxe.

It binds the CDC communication interface (class 0x02 subclass 0x02) and
walks to its sibling data interface for the bulk pair. Subclass 0x02 is
CDC-ACM's alone, so it cannot collide with the RHI NIC on the same USB
device -- which an 0x0A data-class binding would, since ECM and NCM data
interfaces are also 0x0A.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [platform policy]

---

diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -1104,6 +1104,11 @@
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbRndis/UsbRndis.inf
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEem/UsbCdcEem.inf
   #
+  # The BMC's CDC-ACM serial console. Independent of the NIC above: the
+  # console is a convenience, the NIC is the Redfish host interface.
+  #
+  NucRedfishPkg/UsbCdcAcmDxe/UsbCdcAcmDxe.inf
+  #
   # The host-side consumer of EDKII_REDFISH_CONFIG_HANDLER_PROTOCOL. Stock
   # RedfishPlatformConfigDxe (above) is what answers for HII.
   #
diff --git aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
--- aa/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
+++ bb/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
@@ -397,6 +397,7 @@
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcNcm/UsbCdcNcm.inf
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbRndis/UsbRndis.inf
   INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/UsbCdcEem/UsbCdcEem.inf
+  INF NucRedfishPkg/UsbCdcAcmDxe/UsbCdcAcmDxe.inf
   INF NucRedfishPkg/NucRedfishSyncDxe/NucRedfishSyncDxe.inf
   INF NucRedfishPkg/EthConfigDxe/EthConfigDxe.inf
 !if $(REDFISH_CLIENT) == TRUE
